SUMMARY (Airframe)

CAD files (FreeCAD, SCAD, STL), schematics, and structural designs are licensed under
CERN-OHL-W v2. This means:

  • You may use, modify, and distribute the designs
  • You must retain the license notice and make modifications available to others
  • Documentation of changes is required if you convey products based on these designs
  • Compatible proprietary components (External Material) may be used

Documentation and build guides are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (permissive attribution model).

For attribution and contribution guidelines, see:
  ../docs/attribution_and_licensing.md
  ../CONTRIBUTING.md (if present)

---

MODIFICATION NOTICE TEMPLATE

If you modify airframe CAD or designs, add a comment like this to your source files:

  Modified [DATE] by [YOUR NAME]: [brief description of changes]
  Licensed under CERN-OHL-W v2
  See ../docs/attribution_and_licensing.md

